{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Rod of Asclepius",
    "steam_appid": 3484030,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484030/extras/9091c9af7f0301df8708f5893a40e859.avif?t=1755591882\" data-has-big width=800 height=336 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Explore ancient Pannonia, master the art of historical medicine, and uncover the secrets of Late Antiquity in this narrative-driven RPG.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rod of Asclepius</strong> is a historical RPG set in the 4th-century Roman province of <i>Pannonia Secunda</i>. You play as a Roman <i>medicus</i>, responsible for diagnosing, treating, and saving lives using authentic medical techniques from the era. As war and disease spread across the empire, your choices will shape the fate of those around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blending exploration, turn-based medical procedures, and historical accuracy, Rod of Asclepius immerses players in the challenges faced by ancient healers. Investigate mysterious ailments, gather rare herbs, and balance the ethical dilemmas of early medicine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 Authentic Historical Setting \u2013 Explore archeologically researched Roman-era locations, customs, and medical techniques.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 Turn-Based Medical Challenges \u2013 Perform surgeries, mix remedies, and apply treatments in a strategic, skill-based system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 Resource Management \u2013 Collect medicinal plants, tools, and rare ingredients to craft life-saving treatments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 Isometric Pixel Art \u2013 A unique 2.5D pixel-art aesthetic that brings Late Antiquity to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 Investigation &amp; Diagnosis \u2013 Unravel medical mysteries by questioning patients, studying symptoms, and making tough decisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 Morality &amp; Reputation System \u2013 Your medical ethics influence how NPCs react to you and shape your standing in Roman society.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you survive as a healer in a collapsing empire?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > The Medicine of Antiquity Awaits!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wishlist now and begin your journey into the world of Roman healing.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484030/extras/9091c9af7f0301df8708f5893a40e859.avif?t=1755591882\" data-has-big width=800 height=336 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Explore ancient Pannonia, master the art of historical medicine, and uncover the secrets of Late Antiquity in this narrative-driven RPG.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rod of Asclepius</strong> is a historical RPG set in the 4th-century Roman province of <i>Pannonia Secunda</i>. You play as a Roman <i>medicus</i>, responsible for diagnosing, treating, and saving lives using authentic medical techniques from the era. As war and disease spread across the empire, your choices will shape the fate of those around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blending exploration, turn-based medical procedures, and historical accuracy, Rod of Asclepius immerses players in the challenges faced by ancient healers. Investigate mysterious ailments, gather rare herbs, and balance the ethical dilemmas of early medicine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 Authentic Historical Setting \u2013 Explore archeologically researched Roman-era locations, customs, and medical techniques.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 Turn-Based Medical Challenges \u2013 Perform surgeries, mix remedies, and apply treatments in a strategic, skill-based system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 Resource Management \u2013 Collect medicinal plants, tools, and rare ingredients to craft life-saving treatments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 Isometric Pixel Art \u2013 A unique 2.5D pixel-art aesthetic that brings Late Antiquity to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 Investigation &amp; Diagnosis \u2013 Unravel medical mysteries by questioning patients, studying symptoms, and making tough decisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 Morality &amp; Reputation System \u2013 Your medical ethics influence how NPCs react to you and shape your standing in Roman society.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you survive as a healer in a collapsing empire?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > The Medicine of Antiquity Awaits!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wishlist now and begin your journey into the world of Roman healing.</p>",
    "short_description": "Rod of Asclepius is a historical RPG where you play as a Roman medicus in 4th-century Pannonia. Diagnose illnesses, perform treatments, and navigate the challenges of ancient medicine. Explore, gather herbs, and make ethical choices that shape your reputation in a collapsing empire.",
